exports[`recorded view fixtures > git_settings-terminal at 80x24 1`] = `
"── settings ──
 terminal   radar finds one · when it opens

── terminal ──
 What opens a terminal in a checkout (t on a repo or a merge request). Inside
 tmux it is a new tmux window; on a desktop your terminal app; over ssh without
 tmux, radar puts \`cd <folder>\` on your clipboard instead.

 ACCEPTS
 ⏎ picks one of the terminals found here, or type a command line: {dir} is the
 folder, {cmd} the command it runs (else -e is added)

 NOW
 radar finds one · when it opens

 config: [git] terminal












"
`;

