  └─ ▤ acme/docs                                                       0 PRs

── acme/api #42 ──
  ⌂ local folder    no matching origin; link a folder or scan configured
 folders
 Keep background refreshes tied to their request

 state  open
 author  alice
 from  alice/api:refresh-ownership
 into  acme/api:main
 head commit  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

 DESCRIPTION ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   What changed

   Responses stay with the repository and commit they were requested for.

   • Keep the selected pull request stable
   • Show unavailable checks honestly

   See the design notes.





"
`;

