── detail ──
 CHECKED
 not checked yet

 NOW
 https://gitlab.com

 The GitLab server radar talks to.

 ACCEPTS
 https://gitlab.com or your own server's address

 config: [gitlab] url

 ⇌ GET A GITLAB TOKEN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   1 Open GitLab's new-token page:
   gitlab.com / new token   open · copy
     name radar · scope from access: read_api
   2 Pick an expiry date, then Create personal access token.
