exports[`recorded view fixtures > gitlab_settings-look at 80x24 1`] = `
"── settings ──
 MERGE REQUEST STATES
    review   a merge request open for your review                warning · bold
    fix                                                            error · bold
    ready    yours, and ready to merge: nothing in its way       success · bold
    waiting  yours, waiting on approvals or a running pipeline             info
    draft    your draft                                              muted text
    you      the reader, in place of their own name                      accent
    team     a teammate's merge request, not asking you          secondary text
    bot      a merge request from a bot                              muted text
    merged   a merge request that was merged                       third accent
    closed   a merge request closed without merging         muted text · italic
    label    a merge request's labels                            links and keys
 PIPELINES
    passed   a pipeline that passed                                     success
    failed   a pipeline that failed                                error · bold
    running  a pipeline that is running                                    info
    manual   a pipeline waiting for a manual job                           info
    pending  a pipeline that has not started                         muted text
    canceled a pipeline that was canceled                            muted text
    skipped  a pipeline that was skipped                             muted text
 TENANCIES
    code                                                   tenancy's own · bold
    shown    a repo shown in merge requests                             success
    hidden   a repo you have hidden                                  muted text

── review ──
 How a merge request open for your review is drawn.

   sample  review

 colour    ██ warning
           the theme's warning colour, used for things that want you: review,
 unsaved
 emphasis  bold

 What each colour looks like is set in colours, under general.
 config: [gitlab.style] review













"
`;

