── detail ──
 radar found a Jira site in /work/acme/.mcp.json. Do you want to use it?

 FOUND
 gamma.atlassian.net  the site's address, as written
 JIRA_EMAIL           the account

 radar stores only the variables' names (env:NAME) and reads their values each time it starts. It never shows the values or saves them.

 It is the file's "tools" entry. It also watches GAM (acceptance criteria in customfield_10044). Its token is typed into the file: radar does not copy it, and
