"── settings ──
 COMMAND LINE TOOLS

 ◷ Copilot       checking
 ◷ Codex         checking
 ◷ Claude Agent  checking
  + add a command   aider, opencode, …

 NEW SESSIONS · FOR EVERY WORKSPACE

 provider              Copilot
 model                 the provider's own
 working folder        where radar was started
 permitted folders     none
 skill folders         none
 CLI's own config      yes
 always allow          none
 always deny           none
 local only            yes
 reviewer commands     yes

 RECIPES AND REVIEWS

 recipes folder        ~/.config/radar/recipes
 recipe ask            v2 · built-in

── install and sign in ──
 ◷ Reading the CLI's status…
























── detail ──
 Each agent is its own program with its own sign-in. radar finds it on your    █
 PATH; read its status again.                                                  █
                                                                               █
 ◙ COPILOT  checking ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────█
   $ npm i -g @github/copilot                                                  █
   copy command · $ copilot login                                              █
   Needs a Copilot plan on GitHub.                                             █
   ↗  open documentation · GitHub: install Copilot CLI                         █
 ◙ CODEX  checking ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────█
   $ npm i -g @openai/codex                                                    █
   $ codex login                                                               █
   ↗  Codex: install and sign in                                               █
 ◙ CLAUDE AGENT  checking ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────█
   $ npm i -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code                                        █
   $ claude auth login                                                         █
   radar runs your own claude and offers no sign-in of its own.                █
   Anthropic does not allow a claude.ai login in a product: for one it asks for█
   an API key (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY).                                             █
   ↗  Claude Code: set up                                                      █
 $ ANY OTHER CLI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────█
   add a command takes what you would type in a terminal; radar runs it in a   █
   tab of the dock.                                                            ║
 ⚠ NOTHING IS APPROVED FOR YOU ────────────────────────────────────────────────║
   A request waits in the dock for your answer:                                ║
"
`;

